  "description": "The Dolan Titanium ADX. Designed with a higher than normal head tube a shorter top tube and comfortable curved seat stays makes this frame ideal for Audax and Sportive riding, or just long days in the saddle. The road bike frameset also comes equipped with Internal cabling technology this means that the frame will accept either mechanical or electronic groupsets. mudguard (MAX 25mm tyre) and rear pannier mounts making the ADX a great Tourer/Commuter.\n\nADX-INT Requires Deep Drop Brakes (57mm Drop)\n\nFork: Alpina carbon fork 1 1/8 Int, Carbon Fibre Blades, Aluminium Steering Column, Mudguard fittings.\nHeadset: Alpina 1 1/8th Integral - 36*45.\nSeat Clamp: Alpina - Alloy - Black, 34.9.",
